<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (Glossier should prioritize pop-up stores because they allow customers to try products in person while helping the company test local demand before committing to permanent locations. Direct online sales should remain the core channel, with successful pop-ups guiding future showroom openings. A limited Sephora pilot could follow if Glossier can maintain a consistent customer experience.)
